<title>USA: Nebraska fed cattle market not established - USDA.</title>
<headline>Nebraska fed cattle market not established - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers near midday Tuesday were not established on a dressed basis delivered (paid on hot carcass weights), according to USDA.</p>
<p>Dressed Basis Steers: No confirmed sales.</p>
<p>Dressed Basis Heifers: No confirmed sales.</p>
<p>Trade was virtually non-existent on slaughter steers and heifers on a live basis. Buyer inquiry moderate, seller interest light at current bids.</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:  No confirmed sales.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: No confirmed sales.</p>
<p>Sales confirmed:   None.  For the week:   5,200</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
</text>
